+[00-COMMANDS.md](/audit-output/evidence/00-COMMANDS.md), and the complete
+artifact listing is in
+[34-evidence-index.txt](/audit-output/evidence/34-evidence-index.txt).
+
+VERDICT: FAIL
+LEGITIMACY: NOT_LEGIT
